{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07442","headline":"见故人李均所借古镜恨其未获归府斯人已亡怆然有作 · 刘长卿","name":"见故人李均所借古镜恨其未获归府斯人已亡怆然有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人留镜无归处，今日怀君试暂窥。\n岁久岂堪尘自入，夜长应待月相随。\n空怜琼树曾临匣，犹见菱花独映池。\n所恨平生还不早，如今始挂陇头枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}